      "id": "p0251-b001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although the choice to replace \"save\" withft1kkatsll solved most of the wordplay issues, it also slightly altered the logic of the scene. To compensate for this change, the team added an extra line that bridges the jump from \"save\" to ft1kkatst1. Thus, the final Japanese scene became:",
        "raw": "Although the choice to replace \"save\" withft1kkatsll solved most of the\nwordplay issues, it also slightly altered the logic of the scene. To compensate\nfor this change, the team added an extra line that bridges the jump from \"save\"\nto ft1kkatst1. Thus, the final Japanese scene became:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
