    {
      "id": "p0251-b002",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Yot1 reached for yol.lr save file. Bllt nothing happened. Yot1 reached for yow· save file again. Nothing happened. It appears yol.1 can't restore yow· save file after all.",
        "raw": "Yot1 reached for yol.lr save file. Bllt nothing happened.\nYot1 reached for yow· save file again. Nothing happened.\nIt appears yol.1 can't restore yow· save file after all.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.13798352,
          0.15889286,
          0.55023672,
          0.20830714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.13666223,
          0.15817857,
          0.55155802,
          0.20937857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "你向自己的存档伸出手。却什么也没有发生。你再次向存档伸出手。什么也没有发生。看来，终究无法恢复存档。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
